					<description><![CDATA[<h3>Applications</h3>
<ul>
 	<li>Biopharmaceuticals.</li>
 	<li>Fine chemical industry.</li>
 	<li>Printing and dyeing industry.</li>
 	<li>The food industry.</li>
 	<li>New energy industry.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Product features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Multiple processes such as filtration, washing, and drying can be completed within the equipment, with continuous operation throughout the entire process, suitable for sterile and non sterile pharmaceutical, chemical and other industries.</li>
<li>Suitable for working conditions with high solid content, where solid and liquid phases need to be recycled separately.</li>
<li>The design and assembly of the equipment strictly follow the national GMP requirements, fully comply with the requirements of the drug production process, and the system is safe, stable, and reliable</li>
<li>The internal surface of equipment in contact with materials is flat, smooth, and free of dead corners, making it easy to clean and disinfect.</li>
<li>After mechanical fine polishing or electrolytic polishing, the inner surface of the equipment Ra ≤ 0.35UM, and the outer surface of the equipment Ra ≤ 0.80UM</li>
<li>The equipment should not cause pollution to the environment outside the device, and proper measures should be taken to prevent dust, leakage, and isolation heat and noise reduction measures. Fully enclosed working state, motor, reducer, lifting device adopting shell protection, the jacket layer is coated with insulation cotton for insulation or cooling, reducing heat loss and external heat exchange and its impact on the environment.</li>
<li>Using horizontally laid filter media, filter thoroughly at once without any residue. The unique sealing structure of the filter material makes it convenient and fast to replace the filter material.</li>
<li>Using horizontally laid filter media, filter thoroughly at once without any residue. The unique sealing structure of the filter material makes it convenient and fast to replace the filter material.</li>
<li>Dry double end mechanical seal, ammonia protection and cooling, mixing shaft equipped with corrugated pipe protection.</li>
<li>Automatic discharge to avoid pollution.</li>
<li>Equipped with online cleaning and sterilization functions.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Structural drawings</h3>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5442" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filtering-washing-and-drying-integrated-machine-03-detail1.jpg" alt="" width="461" height="475" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filtering-washing-and-drying-integrated-machine-03-detail1.jpg 461w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filtering-washing-and-drying-integrated-machine-03-detail1-291x300.jpg 291w" sizes="(max-width: 461px) 100vw, 461px" /></p>
<p>A: Rotary Joint.<br />
B: Drive device.<br />
C: Machine rack.<br />
D: Hydraulic lifting device.<br />
E: mechanical seal.<br />
F: CIP device.<br />
G: Pressure resistant tank body.<br />
H: corrugated pipe.<br />
I: Tank bottom lifting device.<br />
J: blade.<br />
K; Hydraulic locking flange.<br />
L: Tank bottom pulley.<br />
M: Dust collector.<br />
N: Hydraulic discharge device.<br />
O: Hydraulic locking device.</p>
<h3>Functions</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Feed; Filtering:</strong><br />
Realize solid-liquid separation under vacuum or pressure.</li>
<li><strong>Flat material:</strong><br />
The agitator scraper rotates in reverse to smooth out the cracks on the surface of the filter cake, avoiding washing short circuit of liquid along cracks.</li>
<li><strong>Mixing and washing:</strong><br />
By rotating the spray ball to evenly spray the cleaning solution into the container, it is possible to achieve internal cleaning Part cleaning and filter cake rinsing. Stir the filter cake and washing solution through a lifting stirrer mixing to thoroughly wash the material.</li>
<li><strong>Drying:</strong><br />
In a vacuum state, the agitator rotates forward to scrape the filter cake layer by layer, and the heating system of the equipment uniformly heats the filter cake to accelerate the evaporation of the washing solution and fully dry the material.</li>
<li><strong>Online sampling:</strong><br />
During the drying process, material sampling inspection can be carried out through the powder sampling valve: automatic discharge:<br />
After drying is completed, the mixer rotates forward, scrapes and pushes the material to automatically discharge from the discharge port on the equipment side.</li>
</ul>
