					<description><![CDATA[<h3>ES-MS-R/V Modular Self-cleaning Filter</h3>
Modular self-cleaning filter is designed based on the modular concept, combining multiple standard filtration units into a fully automatic filtration system. The system has a high safety factor and can flexibly increase the number of online units according to traffic needs. Modular self-cleaning filters operate automatically without manual cleaning, with strong scalability. They can be externally connected to high-pressure backwashing fluids and operate with low pressure differential. V-SLOT filter elements are used for thorough backwashing, which consumes less liquid. Modular self-cleaning filters can purify fluids, protect critical downstream equipment, and also utilize their backwash effluent to recover expensive solid particles. The product is suitable for low viscosity liquids, such as raw water, sewage, gasoline, heavy-duty coking gasoline, diesel, residual oil, etc]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Modular self-cleaning filters are divided into four series:</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>MS-R series</strong>, automatic backwashing type of filtrate, uses the filtrate from other filtering units to backwash the filter cake on the outer surface of the filter elemen.</li>
<li><strong>MS-V series</strong>, external fluid automatic backwashing, using external clean fluid (liquid or gas) to flush the surface filter cake of the filter element; MS-T series, filtrate manual backwash type; MS-G series, external fluid manual backwash type.</li>
