										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>CFH Series Cartridge Filter</h3>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5422" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFH-Series-Cartridge-Filter-02-detail1.jpg" alt="" width="535" height="435" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFH-Series-Cartridge-Filter-02-detail1.jpg 535w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFH-Series-Cartridge-Filter-02-detail1-300x244.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 535px) 100vw, 535px" /></p>
<h3>CFT Series Cartridge Filter</h3>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5423" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFT-Series-Cartridge-Filter-detail2.jpg" alt="" width="535" height="435" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFT-Series-Cartridge-Filter-detail2.jpg 535w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFT-Series-Cartridge-Filter-detail2-300x244.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 535px) 100vw, 535px" /></p>
<h3>Product Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Standard structural design, using carbon steel and stainless steel materials (304, 316L).</li>
<li>Four pressure classes,cover all the industrial applications.</li>
<li>Design standards can meet customer requirements.</li>
<li>Rugged element mounting for simple prefiltration to sub micron removal.</li>
<li>The closed cover of the filter tightly compresses the filter element to ensure reliable sealing of the filter element.</li>
<li>Strict international design standards ensure safe operation under all operating conditions.</li>
<li>Fatal and carcinogenic high-risk liquids can be safely filtered without causing harm to operators.</li>
<li>Slip bolt or quick-opening options available to reduce component replacement time.</li>
<li>All-welded structure provides flexibility for customer’s modifications.</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3>Typical Applications</h3>
<ul>
<li>General Particle Filtration.</li>
<li>Catalyst &amp; Soot Filtration.</li>
<li>Membrane Prefiltration.</li>
<li>Seawater filtration.</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
